          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: SAINTE-ANNE (972) 01.09.1987 PV n°1362 (1987307035).pdf CAPESTERRE-BELLE-EAU (971) 01.09.1987 PV n°1391 (1987307036).pdf SAINT-GEORGES (973) 01.09.1987 T1 PV n°263 (1987307037).pdf LAMENTIN (LE) (972) 01.09.1987 T1 PV n°460 (1987307038).pdf SAINT-GEORGES (973) 01.09.1987 T2 PV n°263 (1987307037).pdf LAMENTIN (LE) (972) 01.09.1987 T2 PV n°460 (1987307038).pdf",
          "text_sha256": "25549b24d730cb97214fb2af962681f7112587790c08070932703ddafe1d2283"
